      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T12:16:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggestion: if the goal is to closely observe the differences between the two systems, would a larger font size help with that more? Or are the differences subtle anti-aliasing things which are unimportant?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 28,
        "startChar": 16,
